    "sections": {
        "description": "The Consultancy Firm Theme is a professional, multipurpose, and modern solution designed for consulting businesses including business consultancy, management consulting, financial consulting, IT consulting, HR consulting, legal consulting, tax consulting, real estate consulting, SME consulting, staffing consultancy, and recruitment agencies. With a sleek, minimal, and intuitive layout, it offers full customization for corporate and personal branding, making it ideal for corporate strategy, business growth, market research, risk management, project management, sales consulting, digital consulting, organizational development, investment consulting, leadership training, HR solutions, and change management services. The responsive, mobile-friendly design ensures smooth navigation on desktops, tablets, and smartphones, while optimized and secure code guarantees fast loading and reliable performance. Interactive banners, testimonial sections, strategically placed call-to-action buttons, and social media integration enhance user engagement, credibility, and conversions. Built on the Bootstrap framework with easy-to-use shortcodes, the theme is translation-ready, SEO-friendly, and fully compatible with WooCommerce for service payments, Contact Form 7 for lead generation, and WPML for multilingual functionality, empowering consulting firms to establish a professional, high-performing, and globally accessible online presence that drives growth and client trust."
    },
